# Printing

## Case: hello

### Auto

```auto
fn main() {
    print("hello")
}
```

### VM

```text
hello
```

### Rust

```rust
// Auto-generated by a2r transpiler

fn main() {
    println!("hello");
}
```

### C

#### hello.h

```c
#pragma once

#include <stdio.h>
```

#### hello.c

```c
#include "hello.h"

int main(void) {
    printf("%s\n", "hello");
    return 0;
}
```

